A cascading waterfall of knowledge flowing through interconnected geometric pools, each level representing a tier of Singapore's education system, with small figures of students climbing upward along flowing streams of information, set against a backdrop of tropical greenery and modern architecture, rendered in the swirling, expressive brushstrokes and vibrant blues, yellows, and greens characteristic of Vincent van Gogh, with dynamic movement in the sky suggesting the flow of learning from institution to classroom to individual mind, textured impasto technique creating depth and energy throughout the composition.
